Weaving begins at the base, flat on the knee. There is no mould and no drawing; the pattern is counted in the weaver''s head. A large sculptural piece takes eight to twelve days. The rim is finished by a leather worker in Bolgatanga market, stitching with waxed thread.

Baskets are folded flat for the journey. A mist of warm water and ten minutes of patient shaping brings them back to full form — this is the last step of the weave, and you perform it yourself.','/__l5e/assets-v1/3f1fce51-4358-4890-98cf-4a51f4535186/artisan.jpg','Vetastudio',6,now() - interval '12 days',ARRAY['craft','process']),
('Reshaping a folded basket','reshaping-a-folded-basket','Your basket travels flat. Here is the ten-minute ritual that returns it to shape.','Fill a spray bottle with warm water. Mist the outside of the basket until the grass darkens slightly — damp, never soaked. Work the walls outward with both hands, pressing from the inside, turning as you go.

Stuff the basket loosely with towels or paper to hold the volume and leave it overnight away from direct sun and radiators. In the morning remove the filling; the grass will have dried into its new memory.

Repeat once or twice a year, or any time the shape softens.','/__l5e/assets-v1/c9b30099-29a0-4b71-864e-c7f30d51aae5/bolga-hero.jpg','Vetastudio',4,now() - interval '30 days',ARRAY['care','guide']),
('Fair wages in the weaving cooperatives','fair-wages-in-the-weaving-cooperatives','What fair-trade certification actually changes in a Sumbrungu weaving household.','A fair price for a basket is not one number. It is the grass, the dye, the days, and the leather — and then the difference between a middleman''s price and a cooperative price, which is usually the school fees.

Vetastudio buys directly from three cooperatives around Bolgatanga and publishes the per-piece rate paid to the weaver. Payment is made at collection, not on sale, so the risk sits with us rather than with the household.','/__l5e/assets-v1/3f1fce51-4358-4890-98cf-4a51f4535186/artisan.jpg','Vetastudio',5,now() - interval '45 days',ARRAY['transparency','artisans']);


